    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 15 Rivermill is a well-positioned two-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 67 sq. m., situated within this popular and fully gated apartment development in Navan. The property is presented in good condition throughout and offers a comfortable and practical layout, making it an attractive option for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors.\n\nThe development enjoys extremely convenient access to Navan town centre, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities all within easy reach. Excellent motorway access also provides convenient connections towards Dublin and surrounding areas, while local bus services further enhance the property's accessibility. With its secure gated setting and highly convenient location, No. 15 Rivermill represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located apartment in Navan."
      },
